{"3962520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Handgun Football", "steam_appid": 3962520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handgun Football is a first-person shooter game that combines football and firearms. Use revolvers and shotguns to shoot the football into the opposing team's goal until the goal's health points reach zero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/af581ee6581105dfdbd2097242971cfa.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/af581ee6581105dfdbd2097242971cfa.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/af581ee6581105dfdbd2097242971cfa.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports 12-player local network and P2P connection, as well as single-player mode against AI opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/b9e733792de75e57980914af985947ad.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/b9e733792de75e57980914af985947ad.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/b9e733792de75e57980914af985947ad.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traditional football matches only involve two teams on Earth, but this game offers additional modes beyond the standard two-team format: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/dda6ebea402256453dfaeb414150a26b.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/dda6ebea402256453dfaeb414150a26b.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/dda6ebea402256453dfaeb414150a26b.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/a544544c872e469d0caf494a5e08ed1f.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/a544544c872e469d0caf494a5e08ed1f.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/a544544c872e469d0caf494a5e08ed1f.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space two-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/d1aae6f9db381ef1194f4ce1650a3216.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/d1aae6f9db381ef1194f4ce1650a3216.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/d1aae6f9db381ef1194f4ce1650a3216.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space three-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/189f35b6cff02176c21605a385c4a7df.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/189f35b6cff02176c21605a385c4a7df.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/189f35b6cff02176c21605a385c4a7df.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space four-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/007c23766076becbe8eccad28c52cb31.poster.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/007c23766076becbe8eccad28c52cb31.webm?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/007c23766076becbe8eccad28c52cb31.mp4?t=1774968018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal's health points can be customized by the host. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In single-player mode, the difficulty can be adjusted using a slider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/74ae4fea7de13d7a543f26bfa6cfe51d.avif?t=1774968018\" width=400 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr